# Source of truth

Start discovery at `docs/index.md`. Only `type: Specification` concepts
define product acceptance. Code and executed tests provide implementation
evidence; plans, tickets, chats, and integrations do not replace specifications.

Every non-reserved Markdown file under `docs/` must have parseable YAML
frontmatter and a non-empty `type`. `index.md` and `log.md` are reserved by
OKF. Use `status` only for `draft|stable|deprecated`; use extension fields
such as `spec_status`, `workflow_state`, and `finding_status` for domain
lifecycle.
